4379	/// ADR-0020 §4 wants at least 64 semantic mutants at a 100% kill rate. The
4380	/// packet declares 65, each naming the tests that would catch it — and as of
4381	/// 2026-08-03 **not one of those 35 distinct tests is runnable**: 27 exist only
4382	/// as strings in the packet (M18–M24 have not been authorized, so
4383	/// `conformance/tests/milestones/` has no m18..m24 at all), and the remaining 8
4384	/// exist but are `#[ignore]`d under the AM-17.2 Phase 1 quarantine.
4385	///
4386	/// A kill demonstrated by a test that does not exist is not demonstrated. A
4387	/// kill demonstrated by a test nobody runs is not demonstrated either — an
4388	/// `#[ignore]`d test cannot fail, so it cannot witness anything.
